2026-07-13T07:11:07.3770031Z     The ``pytest`` framework makes it easy to write small tests, yet
2026-07-13T07:11:07.3770510Z     scales to support complex functional testing for applications and libraries.
2026-07-13T07:11:07.3770895Z     
2026-07-13T07:11:07.3771243Z     An example of a simple test:
2026-07-13T07:11:07.3771481Z     
2026-07-13T07:11:07.3771672Z     .. code-block:: python
2026-07-13T07:11:07.3771897Z     
2026-07-13T07:11:07.3772099Z         # content of test_sample.py
2026-07-13T07:11:07.3772352Z         def inc(x):
2026-07-13T07:11:07.3772561Z             return x + 1
2026-07-13T07:11:07.3772774Z     
2026-07-13T07:11:07.3772943Z     
2026-07-13T07:11:07.3773129Z         def test_answer():
2026-07-13T07:11:07.3773359Z             assert inc(3) == 5
2026-07-13T07:11:07.3773723Z     
2026-07-13T07:11:07.3773889Z     
2026-07-13T07:11:07.3774069Z     To execute it::
2026-07-13T07:11:07.3774266Z     
2026-07-13T07:11:07.3774443Z         $ pytest
